              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 31:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ezira umuherezi azana ico gitabo c’ivyagezwe, agishira imbere y’ishengero ry’abagabo n’abagore n’abandi bose bafise ubgenge bgo kwumva. Hari ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira agisoma ahagaze yerekeye ico kibuga kir’ imbere y’irembo ry’amazi, agisomera abagabo n’abagore n’ abandi bashoboye kwumva, uhereye mu mutwenzi ugashitsa mu mashōka, kand’ abantu bose bari bateze amatwi bumviriza ivy’ ico gitabo c’ivyagezwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira, uwo munyabgenge w’ivyanditswe, yar’ ahagaze ku mutara w’ibiti, bubakiye ico gikorwa nyene, yar’ ahagararanye na Matitiya na Shema na Anaya na Uriya na Hilukiya na Mayaseya; abo ni bo bār’ i buryo bgiwe; i bumoso bgiwe hāri Pedaya na Mishayeli na Malikiya na Hashumu na Hashibadana na Zekariya na Meshulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ezira azingurura igitabo abantu bose babona, kuko yar’ ahagaze ahisumbuye; maz’ akikizingurura abantu bose bava hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
