        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira araheza ahimbaza Uhoraho Imana isumba vyose, abantu bose bashira amaboko hejuru, bati Amen, Amen. Baraheza barunama bashika hasi imbere y’Uhoraho, bubika amaso kw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
