        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi ugira kabiri abakuru b’amyazu ya ba sekuruza bo mu bantu bose, n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, bakoranira kuri Ezira umunyabgenge w’ivyanditswe, kugira ngo bashire ayo majambo y’ivyagezwe ku mitima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
